<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL: VIOMETAL ESKIMO SHORTENS NAME.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL: VIOMETAL ESKIMO SHORTENS NAME.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viometal Eskimo ABE has shortened its name to Eskimo ABE and is switching from the Metallurgical Category to Miscellaneous Category, the Athens bourse announced.</p>
<p>--Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
